(text "AP / BASE BOARD (SEPARATE PCB).  U851 = XMOS XU316-1024-QF60B xcore.ai USB audio bridge (CONFIRMED): UAC2 async USB + I2S slave TX (FPGA is the clock master) + SPI master to the FPGA register map + SPI slave to the host + I2C master to the sensor bus.  B variant = 3.3 V IO banks, matching the AP domain; VDDIOB18 stays 1.8 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 15.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "72f7ccf0-d31b-4b0a-b7cb-2678d0ccc003"))
(text "MOAT MODEL (user ruling 2026-11-01) - two barriers, three ground domains:  external world (USB_GND) -> J852 -> D851 TVS -> L851 CM choke -> U852 ISOUSB211 (moat 1, cable side powered by VBUS via internal LDOs) -> XMOS in GND_AP -> carrier isolators U501-504 (moat 2) -> FPGA/analog GND.  USB_GND NEVER meets GND_AP; the connector shell bonds to chassis PE at the panel, not to any board net." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 22.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "581cf87c-196f-4148-be6f-e541ff4c2323"))
(text "POWER (tree DRAWN, XMOS-prescribed discrete sequencing - user ruling 2026-11-01): VAP_IO = 3.3 V straight from the RS-25-3.3 brick via J854 (no VAP5) -> U854 TLV74318 LDO -> VAP18 (~55 mA max: USB_VDD18 + VDDIOB18) AND -> U855 TPS628502 buck -> VAP09 (0.9 V core, 1.11 A max).  U856 TPS389001 SENSEs VAP18 (~1.65 V trip) and gates the buck EN = IO-before-core ordering; U855 PG open-drain wire-ANDs XMOS_RST_N (R854 pull-up + C861 delay) = reset releases only when the LAST rail is up. One $0.70 supervisor + a divider replaces a $15 13-rail sequencer.  PLL_AVDD is a 0.9 V domain - off VAP09 via L852/C862/C863 (was mis-assigned to VAP18 in early notes)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 29.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3b05c104-3cc8-45ef-911c-202e01d9bccf"))
(text "XU316 GPIO allocation (proposed; firmware owns final port assignment):  FPGA SPI master: X0D32/33/35/36 = SCLK/CS_N/MOSI/MISO.  I2S slave TX: X0D37/38 BCLK/LRCLK in, X0D40 SDATA out.  Sensor I2C: X0D41/42. AP_IRQ_N (FPGA->AP) = X0D43.  Host link (SPI slave, host is master): X0D00/29/39/11 = CS_N/SCLK/MISO/MOSI, X0D30 = doorbell IRQ -> host.  USB attach detect = X1D16.  Future S/PDIF input lands on X1D22." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 36.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "66e2c80c-1e30-44b9-9f77-579fc66517c8"))
(text "USB front end: J852 USB-C (CC1/CC2 5.1k Rd, shell->CHASSIS_PE, milled-pocket presentation) -> D852 VBUS TVS + D851 TVS -> L851 CM choke -> U852 ISOUSB211 -> U851 USB PHY pins. VBUS1/VCC1 = cable VBUS (internal LDOs generate V3P3V1/V1P8V1; bypass caps only).  Side 2 = VAP_IO domain (VBUS2+V3P3V2+VCC2 to VAP_IO; internal LDO generates V1P8V2).  EQ straps to ground = default equalization; CDPENZx high = charging port advertising OFF.  V2OK (side-2-powered flag) is unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 45.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "05167723-4ce9-482d-b76c-6b1981c058ad"))
(symbol (lib_id "Connector:USB_C_Receptacle") (at 59.690 74.930 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "474a153b-0809-4cd6-90db-c39e70404e64") (property "Reference" "J852" (at 62.690 73.630 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "USB-C 16P" (at 62.690 76.230 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "Connector_USB:USB_C_Receptacle_GCT_USB4085" (at 59.690 74.930 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 59.690 74.930 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "USB 2.0-only USB-C receptacle at the AP-board edge, presented through a MILLED face pocket (chassis wall 5-8 mm, user ruling 2026-11-01 - no panel-mount part needed).  FULL THROUGH-HOLE part (user durability ruling): shell stakes AND all 16 signal pins are THT - max cable-torque retention vs hybrid SMD-pin parts; ~1-2mm lead stubs acceptable at USB-HS edge rates.  CC1/CC2 = 5.1k Rd pull-downs to USB_GND (advertises UFP/device, 5 V default - no PD); A6/B6 D+ and A7/B7 D- strapped by shared symbol pins; SuperSpeed TX/RX + SBU pins NC (XMOS PHY is USB 2.0 HS only - 480 Mbps, ~20x UAC2 384k need).  Shell bonds to chassis PE at the entry point - NOT to USB_GND or GND_AP" (at 59.690 74.930 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "USB4085-GF-A (RULED 2026-11-01, user; ~27.7k Newark 2026-11; hybrid alternates HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12 (JLC) / Wurth 632723300011 / Amphenol 12401610E4-2A)" (at 59.690 74.930 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "A1" (uuid "34587db2-c94f-475f-98cb-1190ec717099")) (pin "A2" (uuid "778c38de-9ba5-41af-b82c-9dce84157935")) (pin "A3" (uuid "152b8276-d4e5-4128-a314-ed29ce03b0c8")) (pin "A4" (uuid "9370b05c-bf0d-402e-af5d-7e35391baba3")) (pin "A5" (uuid "6a207485-5724-49fb-9bd5-4f1c13c17547")) (pin "A6" (uuid "0cde982d-c0a5-4c0d-aaef-dbbef6945917")) (pin "A7" (uuid "e96f78ab-3cc6-4358-95aa-614ded2