(text "QSPI: boot pins live on VDDIOL (3.3 V on QF60B).  R851 = CS_N pull-up; R852 = 4.7k BOOTSEL pull-down on D1 = QSPI-master boot (pull high instead -> SPI-slave boot mode, used for factory programming)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300.000 85.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a702bf27-481b-4302-872c-5d0ec0f53bd0"))
(text "U853 = IS25LP016D-JBLE, 2 MiB: JEDEC ID (9Fh) = 9D 60 15 (** VERIFY Table 8.5 on first silicon **); 256 B page, 4 kB uniform sectors.  XMOS map: loader+factory @0, CRC-versioned upgrade images, data partition tail (xflash --boot-partition-size).  Host reaches the flash THROUGH the XMOS (SPI-slave cmd -> libquadflash) or USB DFU - the QSPI bus is not shared." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300.000 80.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "67ea95da-c9df-4f10-9c19-dc4206790a9c"))
