(text "J851 = xSYS2 debug connector for the XTAG4 adapter (XMOS-prescribed, JTAG-only subset per XU316 ds App F.2): JTAG pins are dedicated IOB-domain pads (TMS 23 / TCK 24 / TDO 20 / TDI 18 / RST_N 21, 1.8 V), pin 1 = VAP18 as VREF_JTAG so the XTAG4 level-shifters ride our rail. Pins 11-20 (VREF_LINK + the xLINK on X1D16-19) stay NC - X1D16 is USB_ATTACH and XMOS rates the link advanced-debug-only. xrun/xgdb debug over this port; xflash writes U853 through JTAG (ds sec 12)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 345.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "69dd8166-4a3d-4a8f-b6aa-9a96dae026e5"))
