(text "J853 = host-SoM mate (connector/SoM part pick pending).  Host is the private-link SPI MASTER; XMOS is the slave - so XMOS cannot initiate: HOST_IRQ_N is the doorbell for async events.  FPGA BCLK/LRCLK fan to both I2S slaves (XMOS + host SAI); host SDATA returns on AP_I2S_DATA2 (U503 ch2).  AP_RST_N: host drives open-drain; the pull-up lives on the carrier (R501 -> VAP_IO)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 200.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3c1c3d1d-57ea-4cb8-92d6-05c2c2a0a52e"))
