(text "J854 = island power entry, Phoenix MSTBV 2,5/4-GF-5,08 + MSTB screw plug (mate for the RS-25-3.3's paired output terminals):  ** POLARITY **  pins 1-2 = +3.3 V (VAP_IO), pins 3-4 = -V return (GND_AP).  2 x 12 A pins/pole vs 6 A brick rating." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130.000 255.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "89ec33dc-41fe-45f1-a831-cca57ef3cdf1"))
(text "XMOS POWER TREE: U854 TLV74318 (EN->VAP_IO always-on) -> VAP18.  U856 TPS389001 watches VAP18 (R857/R858 divider = ~1.65 V trip vs 1.62 V rail min; VDD=VAP_IO, MR->VDD, CT->C882) and releases AP09_EN (open-drain + R859 pull-up) -> U855 TPS628502 EN: the 0.9 V core buck cannot start until the 1.8 V IO bank is proven.  U855: MODE->VIN forced-PWM, R861 = COMP/FSET 0R (internal 2.25 MHz), R862/R863 FB divider 49.9k/100k -> 0.899 V + C881 Cff, L853 1 uH, C879/880 = 2 x 10 u out. U855 PG (open-drain) wire-ANDs XMOS_RST_N with R854/C861 - last-rail-up releases reset, XMOS ds Fig-27 order: VDDIO -> VDDIOB18 -> VDD -> RST_N." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 420.000 345.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7aa57aea-b186-421a-95cc-4ae13d495afb"))
(symbol (lib_id "bfdac:TLV743P") (at 449.580 379.730 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "95e38888-ad11-4ee8-bce0-0d5cc753c064") (property "Reference" "U854" (at 452.580 378.430 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "TLV743P-1.8" (at 452.580 381.030 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-23-5" (at 449.580 379.730 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 449.580 379.730 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "VAP18 LDO: VAP_IO -> 1.8 V fixed, 300 mA class on a ~55 mA max rail (USB_VDD18 36 mA max HS + VDDIOB18 ~20 mA), 1.4 % accuracy, 50 dB PSRR - adequate-tier per user ruling (no uV-noise LDO needed behind two moats).  EN tied to VAP_IO = always-on, self-sequences off the entry rail. 5-pin: 1 IN 2 GND 3 EN 4 NC 5 OUT - NO PG pin (P = active pulldown); rail validity is proven by U856 watching VAP18 directly, per the supervisor-watches-rail doctrine" (at 449.580 379.730 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "TLV74318PDBVR (RULED 2026-11-01, user)" (at 449.580 379.730 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "1" (uuid "c6a06137-e080-44f8-874f-011629eadd15")) (pin "3" (uuid "7fb60f34-4a42-42b8-a7bc-979f586ccdb1")) (pin "2" (uuid "db078b27-cacc-4462-8a57-88db45d3c235")) (pin "5" (uuid "029b26bb-be9f-4e5f-b4b1-14b930275828")) (pin "4" (uuid "9e50ecb5-8ba3-4f41-8acd-20058edea849")) (instances (project "bfdac_analog" (path "/e214d457-f1e0-46ff-82ae-9c5220de0889/5180a859-fbe3-4de7-8d1c-6a68d391933f" (reference "U854") (unit 1)))))
